INT. TAXIDERMY CONVENTION - HOTEL BALLROOM - DAY

Rows of folding tables display mounted pheasants, a wild boar in a bow tie, and one very surprised-looking badger. A banner overhead reads "STUFFED & PROUD."

PERCIVAL TANG, 50s, tweed jacket, nametag crooked, stands behind a table with a glass case of owls. Beside him, BIRGITTA LOWE, 40s, in a lab coat, polishes a fox's eye with a handkerchief. FRANCO BAPTISTE, 30s, goatee and leather apron, argues with HESTER KIMURA, 60s, a judge with a clipboard, about a moose. LUDO KARLSSON, 20s, a nervous intern, stacks brochures into leaning towers.

A TALL WOMAN, 40s, in a black raincoat and sunglasses, stalks down the aisle and stops at the owl case. She leans in until her nose nearly touches the glass.

TALL WOMAN
Are these real?

PERCIVAL
Madam, every feather is authentic.

TALL WOMAN
That's not what I asked.

Birgitta and Percival exchange a look. Hester stops mid-sentence. Franco keeps arguing with her about the moose. Ludo knocks over his tower, and brochures scatter.

HESTER
Franco, the antlers are glued on.

FRANCO
They are mounted, not glued.

TALL WOMAN
I'm looking for a stolen owl.

PERCIVAL
We have forty.

TALL WOMAN
This one's white, with a notch in the left wing, named Gerald.

Birgitta drops her handkerchief. Percival coughs. Ludo freezes with a brochure halfway to his mouth. Franco finally turns from the moose, and Hester follows his gaze to the woman.

BIRGITTA
Gerald?

TALL WOMAN
My late husband's owl.

HESTER
He's taxidermied?

TALL WOMAN
Both of them are.

Ludo makes a noise like a kettle. Everyone stares at him.

LUDO
I sold Gerald yesterday. On the internet.

TALL WOMAN
To whom?

LUDO
A man named Dennis.

The woman removes her sunglasses. Her eyes are bloodshot and furious.

ZOFIA
I'm Zofia Wrobel. And I'd like to speak to Dennis.

PERCIVAL
Ms. Wrobel, I assure you--

ZOFIA
Percival, I know that you know Dennis.

Percival lowers his head. Franco shoves the moose out of the way. Birgitta quietly unlocks the owl case. Inside, a single white owl with a notched wing glares out at the room.

BIRGITTA
Oh no.

HESTER
(writing)
Disqualified.
